  "title": "Perplexity AI Unveils Game-Changing Sonar API for Advanced Search Capabilities",
  "summary": "Perplexity AI launches the Sonar API, offering powerful search capabilities for developers. With two editions, Sonar and Sonar Pro, the API allows customization and supports complex queries using large language models. As competitive pricing and real-time features are set to shake up the AI search market, Sonar is positioned as a serious challenger to industry giants.",
